---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import CtaBand from "../components/CtaBand.astro";
import { site } from "../data/site";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy Policy for DailyDialz marketing site and product communications."
>
  <section class="bg-bg px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-24">
    <article class="prose-legal mx-auto max-w-[760px]">
      <p class="mono-label">LEGAL</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 text-[40px] font-bold text-text sm:text-[48px]">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-text-muted">Last updated: August 3, 2026</p>

      <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>
        Depending on how you interact with us, we may collect: contact details you submit (name, email, message content),
        basic technical data from site visits (IP address, browser type, pages viewed, referrer), and purchase-related
        information processed by our payment provider if you buy a license.
      </p>
      <p>
        The DailyDialz mobile application (v1) is designed to work locally on your device for call-list workflows. Lead
        lists you import on-device are not uploaded to DailyDialz servers by the core local workflow described on this site.
      </p>

      <h2>2. How We Use It</h2>
      <p>We use information to respond to inquiries, provide the product and support, process payments, improve the website, and comply with legal obligations.</p>

      <h2>3. Data Storage & Security</h2>
      <p>
        Marketing site hosting and analytics may be provided by third-party infrastructure (for example Cloudflare). We
        apply reasonable administrative and technical safeguards appropriate to the nature of the data. No method of
        transmission over the internet is completely secure.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Third-Party Sharing</h2>
      <p>
        We may share data with service providers who help us operate the site, email, analytics, and payments—only as needed
        to perform those services. We do not sell your personal information. Payment card data is handled by the payment
        processor, not stored on DailyDialz application servers for the marketing site checkout flow.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        We may use essential cookies required for site operation and optional analytics cookies or similar technologies. You
        can control cookies through your browser settings. If we enable non-essential analytics, we will describe them here
        and provide appropriate controls where required.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>
        Privacy questions: <a class="text-text underline decoration-border underline-offset-4" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>
      </p>
    </article>
  </section>
  <CtaBand />
</BaseLayout>
